  "description": "Lightweight SVG icon support for Avalonia. Three components: SvgSource (IImage), SvgIcon (TemplatedControl with Foreground / Background / StrokeWidth), and the {z:Svg uri} markup extension. Pairs with ZXUI.Svg.Core for parsing + SkiaSharp rendering. Zero external dependencies beyond Avalonia (11+) and ZXUI.Svg.Core. Target framework: net10.0.",
  "id": "ZXUI.Svg",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-09T09:37:51.86Z",
